//
// PyYAML operates on sequences of Unicode code points, while JavaScript strings
// are sequences of UTF-16 code units.  Everything in this port that needs to
// reason about "characters" the way Python does works on arrays of code points
// produced by `toCodePoints`.
//
// No regular expressions are used anywhere in this library.

